    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "为什么「策略梯度定理」会成为人工智能史上值得单独记住的一步？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "基于策略的强化学习需要一个严格公式，说明长期性能如何随策略参数变化。策略梯度定理给出了这一表达式，而且不需要对环境动力学求导。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-1999-policy-gradient-primary", "source-benchcouncil-ai100-catalog"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-1999-policy-gradient-membership", "claim-1999-policy-gradient-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "性能梯度可以写成动作价值估计与策略得分乘积的期望。Actor-critic 方法用学习到的 critic 估计价值，actor 则沿该梯度更新。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-1999-policy-gradient-primary"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-1999-policy-gradient-membership", "claim-1999-policy-gradient-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把策略梯度定理视为现代 actor-critic 和策略优化算法的数学骨架。PPO、自然策略梯度、确定性策略梯度以及许多 RLHF 方法都继承了这一结构。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-1999-policy-gradient-primary", "source-1999-policy-gradient-secondary"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-1999-policy-gradient-membership", "claim-1999-policy-gradient-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「策略梯度定理」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
            "sourceIds": [
                "source-1999-policy-gradient-primary",
                "source-1999-policy-gradient-secondary",
                "source-benchcouncil-ai100-catalog",
                "source-1999-policy-gradient-portrait"
